': 'UPS To Support Distribution Of Approved Vaccine As Part Of Operation Warp Speed', 'text': "ATLANTA, DEC. 12, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- UPS (NYSE:UPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INVOLVEMENT AND FULL SUPPORT OF DISTRIBUTION EFFORTS FOR PFIZER-BIONTECH'S COVID-19 VACCINE AS PART OF OPERATION WARP SPEED. PFIZER'S AND BIONTECH'S VACCINE, APPROVED THROUGH A U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION (EUA), IS THE FIRST TO BE DEPLOYED IN A MONTHS-LONG GLOBAL RACE TO DEVELOP SAFE VACCINES TO COMBAT THE SPREAD OF THE COVID-19 VIRUS."}